# REST API

### Get All Profiles
### curl http://localhost:3000/profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Create New Profile
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo7",
    "password": "1234",
    "mobile": "0999999994",
    "cardId": "1234567890119"
}

### Get some profile by id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/7645b518-749d-4c18-a2e3-93eb3a8d3a49xyz

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo5",
    "password": "1234"
}

### Encode
POST http://localhost:3000/encode

### Decode
POST http://localhost:3000/decode


### Encode (เหมือน POST /profile แต่ไม่บันทึก DB)
POST http://localhost:3000/encode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd",
  "mobile": "0891234567"
}



### GET /profile/:id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/534b102b-d347-48bb-9c00-f2227bdaee8d

### /decode/:id -> ต้องให้ผลเหมือน GET /profile/:id
GET http://localhost:3000/decode/534b102b-d347-48bb-9c00-f2227bdaee8d


